# Generated console/report snapshots (rewritten on every cron run;
# 2026-08-14 gap-analysis follow-up: these were being committed as noise
# alongside unrelated code changes because `git add -A` picked them up on
# every commit. One-off analysis outputs in reports/ (e.g. reports/
# counterfactual_hold_analysis.json, reports/analysis/*.txt) are NOT
# included here -- they're generated once and kept as historical record,
# not continuously rewritten.
reports/console/latest_console_summary.json
reports/signal_strength_decile.json

